- `apps/mobile/` — Expo / React Native app (BP §18). **Expo modules/SDK only — never Expo cloud:** no EAS Build/Submit/Update, no expo-updates, no expo.dev deployment; release builds are local (`npx expo prebuild` then Xcode/fastlane, same ASC-key lane as the native apps) and updates ship through the App Store. The root `.npmrc` sets `node-linker=hoisted` (Metro needs a flat node_modules — never remove it) and `metro.config.js` is monorepo-aware. Distinct identity from any sibling native app: bundle id `{{BUNDLE_PREFIX}}.mobile`, URL scheme `{{CODENAME}}` — change id/scheme/OAuth-redirect/deep-link prefixes TOGETHER. After dependency changes run `npx expo install --fix`. Pure `lib/` helpers get Node-env vitest; UI flows get device E2E (Maestro), not jsdom.
